    "title": "Trail Rangers conquer final expedition for the year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dean Dyer ,\n12 hours ago 5-20-26 (Cleveland) – The White County Trail Rangers capped off their 2026 season this weekend at the “Legends of the Downs” event at Kingston Downs in Rome, Georgia. The elementary mountain bike team faced the challenging “Tail of the Dragon,” a large hill filled with tight and twisty berms. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
